OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy start for most with
OL,6,Fisolated showers, mainly over the
OL,7,FPennines. Turning partly cloudy
OL,8,Fthrough the morning with showers
OL,9,Fdeveloping more widely across the
OL,10,Fregion by midday, with an isolated
OL,11,Fheavy burst possible. Feeling cooler
OL,12,Fin fresh northwest winds.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FShowers ease rapidly to leave
OL,15,Fa mostly partly cloudy and dry
OL,16,Fevening. Overnight, cloud returns with
OL,17,Fsome light rain over the Pennines at
OL,18,Ftimes. A cooler night than recently.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
